# Short 8, "Play it" (vertical, tools/film.py --layout vertical): Haze playing; SEL for PERFORM and three held
# moves, Open, Shut, Echo; then REC held for the effects grid and seven of its sixteen (the ones short 1 didn't
# play): Time x2, Wah, Phone, Crash, Freeze, Wash, Gate, a bar each. Every move on a bar's downbeat.
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there (the cue sheet for the labels).
turn PRESET 7 5
wait 30
expect piece 7
bar 8
wav 17-short-play.wav
film 17-short-play.film
bar 8 HAZE playing (Eb Ionian, 116)
bar 10 SEL: PERFORM
tap SEL
bar 11 white 8 held: OPEN
key w7 down
bar 13 white 9 held: SHUT
key w7 up
key w8 down
bar 15 white 11 held: ECHO
key w8 up
key w10 down
bar 17 let go; SEL off; REC held: the effects grid
key w10 up
tap SEL
press REC
bar 18 white 2: TIME x2
key w1 down
bar 19 white 7: WAH
key w1 up
key w6 down
bar 20 white 8: PHONE
key w6 up
key w7 down
bar 21 white 10: CRASH
key w7 up
key w9 down
bar 22 white 11: FREEZE
key w9 up
key w10 down
bar 23 white 12: WASH
key w10 up
key w11 down
bar 24 white 14: GATE
key w11 up
key w13 down
bar 25 let go
key w13 up
release REC
bar 29 END
filmstop
wavstop
